      "id": "claim_d3c0b63bcdd446b9b1fe8e28af20eec7",
      "statement": "The deepagents.middleware package re-exports its public middleware classes and supporting types (filesystem, summarization, skills, subagents, async_subagents, memory, rubric) from its __init__.py, defining the surface consumers import from deepagents.middleware.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/middleware/__init__.py#L50-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a69636a03e3809c09233f394154a80df0f8b44b060eabba709365796447c94b9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_408faefac079476e9300895e10e35bbe",
      "statement": "Middleware subclasses AgentMiddleware and overrides hooks such as wrap_model_call() that intercept every LLM request before it is sent, letting it filter tools, inject system-prompt context, transform messages, and maintain cross-turn state — capabilities a plain tools= callable (invoked only after the model calls it) cannot provide.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/middleware/__init__.py#L15-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1435c8ef4c404c3f7372b55681a6b4908cf36fa84021c40c84b05cf98dd713f7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_aaa19dacb4e7417ea2d5254dc6f435e2",
      "statement": "FilesystemMiddleware provides the filesystem tool set (ls, read_file, write_file, edit_file, delete, glob, grep, execute), resolves the backend, enforces permission deny rules, scrubs unsupported multimodal content, and offloads oversized tool results; it is the largest and most complex middleware module.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/middleware/filesystem.py#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3c3ab32e710c9d59db204b7c253423aad31bccd520f30428c67795f69b6ded0b:"
